{
  "id": "ISA.60",
  "number": "60",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaia 60",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "60",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 60"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "60",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tiendab Sion ne kigitiach",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’eet, iluu; amu kagoit lapkeiyeng’ung’, ak kagochorjin torornatetab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu, keero, tuchei mesundeito ng’ony, ak kotuch mesundeito ne o bororiosiek: ago chorjinin Jehovah, ak kotook torornatennyi eng’ inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kobwanji bororiosiek lapkeiyeng’ung’, ak kobwanji laitorinik kaluunetab choruneng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yot met ak igeer komoswek tugul: iyumigei ichek tugul, ak kobwanjin: bunu weriguk ole loo, ak keganabu tibiguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igeer anyun ak kikwenyin, ak kobotan muguleldang’ung’ ak kibaraa; amu bwanjinin chang’indab nyanjosiek, bwanjinin magornatosiekab bororiosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuchin chang’indab tambesik, koboto moekab tambesik che bo Midian ak Epa; bunu tugul Sheba: ibu tahabu ak tuguk che nyamdut, ak komwaita kalosunoikab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyumjinin akwotisiek tugul che bo kechirekab Kedar, koboisieun mengichikab Nebaiot: bwanei amu taachaksei eng’ kaptisisiennyu, ak atorori gotab torornatennyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’o chu ruaei ko u boldet, ak kotirirendos cheptugenik eng’ tirisiokwak? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igena iman ngegusiek, ak sib kogena melisiek che bo Tarsis, si kobiit komut weriguk eng’ ole loo, koibu fedaisiekwak ak tahabusiekwak, agobo kainetab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, ak agobo Inendet ne Tilil ne bo Israel, amu kigotororin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koteech toek irimoiguk, ak koboisieun laitorinikwak: amu kiabirin eng’ neregekyuk, ago kiarirenen amu chamennyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyatei kogeny ormarichoguk kotugul; magigerei bet anan kemoi; si koibun bik magornatosiekab bororiosiek, koboto laitorinikwak che kimutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu lusei bororiet ak bounatet ne maboisieun; ee, king’emei bororiosiechoto kobetyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyonjinin torornatetab Lebanon, koboto biribirinik, taragonik che sabulen, ak taragonik che ter; si koyai konyol oldanyu ne tilil, ak achob ole tebe kelyekyuk kogararanit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kobwanjin werikab icheget che kiinyalilin kong’urugonu; ak kogutung’so eng’ keldebesaikab kelyeguk ichek tugul che kisasin; ak koguurenen, Nganasetab Jehovah, Sion ne bo Inendet ne Tilil ne bo Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ko u ye kiga kebagakten, ak kewechin, kot ko kima kota komi chi ne kibunei kwenung’ung’, ayain anyun iegu telunatet ne bo koigeny, boiboiyetab ibinwek che chang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichuchuni kogeny chegab bororiosiek, ak irerie kinaikab laitorinik: si kobiit inai ile ane Jehovah, ko a yetindeng’ung’, ak ko katiagindeng’ung’, Inendet ne bo Kamuktaet ne bo Jakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aibu tahabu ageere sugunonik, ak aibu feda ageere karik, ak ageere sugunonik ketik, ak ageere karik koik: ak ayai kogeny kiptainiguk koek kalyet, ak ayai kayagiguk koek imanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kegasei kogeny koromnatet eng’ emeng’ung’, anan kobiit kubernatet ak ng’emisiet eng’ kiwotosieguk; ago tun iguure irimoiguk Yetunet, ak iguure ormarichoguk Kalosunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma koegu asista lapkeiyeng’ung’ bet: ama kogonin lapkeiyet kaluunetab arawet: ago egu Jehovah lapkeiyeng’ung’ ne bo koigeny; ak koek Kamuktaindeng’ung’ torornateng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma kororoktoi asistang’ung’, ama komei araweng’ung’: amu egu Jehovah lapkeiyeng’ung’ ne bo koigeny, ak kogesgei betusiekab rireguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koek che bo imanda kogeny biguk tugul, ak koek emet borotenywa koigeny; temet ne kiamin, boisietab eunekyuk, si kobiit kegonyita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egu ne ming’in elfut, ak koek ne ming’in bororiet ne kim: achokyini noto ane Jehovah eng’ betunnyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
